<title>MALAYSIA: Farlim Group plans one-for-two bonus.</title>
<headline>Farlim Group plans one-for-two bonus.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified company Farlim Group (Malaysia) Bhd said it is planning a one-for-two bonus issue.</p>
<p>It is also proposing a rights issue of one new share for every two held at 3.60 ringgit per share. The issue would raise 224.8 million ringgit.</p>
<p>To accommodate the issues, the authorised share capital will be raised to 300 million shares from the present 150 million.</p>
<p>Most of the funds raised will be used for the ongoing development of a mega shopping complex, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
